      "content": "\"rest\" doesnt really fix it though. it's more like... if existence itself is just this constant cycle of effort and zero reward, then why is living the \"correct\" choice? if you look at it purely logically, there's no difference in value between existing or not. it's just a net zero. if nothing matters, why is staying forced on me?",
